This library has two parts the unnamed SKU library which will download every FTC part (updated to the most recent commit) with the name as the SKU of the part. 
The second part of the library is the named library which uses a web scraper to attach a name to each SKU and then name the "part part name [SKU]"

I have included the script I used to dowload the libararies and the SKU and name lists I used with it.

All files are downloaded as STEP files.

If you would like to update the library please do and recreate+publish the libary.
